``` Firewall log field integrity (data quality, not a threat)
    Flags physically impossible records: ICMP with a port number, and private source IPs carrying a GeoIP country.
    Result on the original dataset: 56 ICMP+port records; every 192.168.x source tagged with 5-6 countries. ```
index=fw_lab sourcetype=fw:traffic
| eval issue=case(protocol="ICMP" AND isnotnull(port), "ICMP record has a port", cidrmatch("192.168.0.0/16", src_ip) AND isnotnull(country), "private source IP has a country", true(), null())
| where isnotnull(issue)
| stats count AS records dc(src_ip) AS sources BY issue
